  m_text: "Hi \u2014 I'm a new graduate student from Hali\xE7 University. This experience
    is only a slice of what Midnight Scour could become with environmental expansion
    and by building further on the foundations we set here. We're looking to grow
    the budget and scope for the full game, and your feedback is the most important
    guide for how we move forward."
